            <ArticleTitle>[What is your diagnosis? Costo-chondritis obscured by x-ray double-exposure].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The case of a 64 years old female patient with chest pain, dizziness and abnormal chest x-ray is presented. The different diagnostic possibilities are discussed. The final assessment in the case was a double radiographic exposure of the chest film confusing the clinical picture.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
